  <Docs>
    <summary>Specifies a line-break configuration's hyphenation preference.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para><see cref="F:Android.Graphics.Text.LineBreakHyphenation.Unspecified" /> preserves the existing preference when configurations are merged. It resolves to enabled when used for text layout. An enabled preference does not override a line breaker's <see cref="F:Android.Graphics.Text.HyphenationFrequency.None" /> setting.</para>
      <para>This enum exposes the <c>HYPHENATION_*</c> constants from <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/99b01a65cc4c104933788b3143285ab6bae65827/graphics/java/android/graphics/text/LineBreakConfig.java">Android 16 LineBreakConfig</a></format>.</para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
